{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn11le01ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well ... It's been three hours since he left and I am supposed to be getting the kitchen ready for dinner. I can't function without my fridge. The restaurant will open in two hours.  Look I need an answer. Will someone be here with the hoses before then? No more ambiguity! Either way, you need to give me an answer in order that I know whether to cancel tonight's reservations or not! ... Well if you won't tell me then put me through to someone who will ... You'll call me back? Yup. Fine.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey V?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh I am relieved to see you.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I am here in order to help you.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn11le01ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Will you open the bags of ice and put them in the large sink? That's going to be my makeshift fridge. <br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'll do whatever you need me to do. <br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: In order to get prepared for dinner, I've sent Michael to get steaks, fish and duck. The menu is limited tonight and the kitchen will close at 10 in order to  keep the food fresh. Can you promise you'll be here to get ice if we need it? <br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You know I will. What happened to the guy who came here to fix the fridge?", "id": 2, "time": "44000", "image": "engenn11le01ob05re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I don't know and, so as to not go completely ballistic, I have come up with a shortened dinner service and a limited menu for tonight. We have seven reservations which I am not cancelling.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  V, it's a great plan and it will work ... and I will do whatever it is that  helps you, but I mean, why are you killing yourself? Why not close up shop for 24 hours? Your loyalty, perseverance and consistency are admirable but your sanity is of utmost importance.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: My sanity hinges on Jim bringing those darn hoses!", "id": 3, "time": "70500", "image": "engenn11le01ob05re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le01ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le01ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about customer relations. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express willingness and refusal, and make promises and threats. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about the purpose of an action or an event.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What are some things you have no trouble waiting for? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What are you impatient about? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Are you the type of person who is early, late or always on time? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "We all need to be patient sometimes.", "t