olve her situation immediately. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 2, "_data": [{"content": "The person she called is not completely prepared to offer Vanessa a quick solution. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": 1}, {"id": 3, "_data": [{"content": "The person she called is talking clearly and ready to offer a solution.   ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": 0}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn11le01ob05re3aud02", "type": "audio"}, {"content": "What does she plan to do without her fridge? ", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "She's going to offer a normal service in her restaurant. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "She's going to offer a smaller service with fewer options in the menu. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}, {"id": 2, "_data": [{"content": "She's going to offer a regular service with fewer options in the menu. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": 0}, {"id": 3, "_data": [{"content": "She's going to close the restaurant tonight.   ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": 0}], "id": 1}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn11le01ob05re3aud03", "type": "audio"}, {"content": "What does Peter try to do? ", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "He tries to encourage her to keep the restaurant open. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "He tries to encourage her to work harder to get the service completed. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 2, "_data": [{"content": "He tries to encourage her to close for a day to keep her mental health. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": 1}, {